    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_select_01",
      "hash64": "CA217CEB2A799D4C",
      "text": "Habe ich nicht.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_select_02",
      "hash64": "CA217FEB2A79A265",
      "text": "Bin gerade erst hergekommen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_05",
      "hash64": "A86EB893E1A4C571",
      "text": "N-Natürlich. So etwas machst du doch nicht...\\nEntschuldige die seltsame Frage.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_06",
      "hash64": "A86EB593E1A4C058",
      "text": "In letzter Zeit beschleicht mich immer wieder\\ndieses seltsame Gefühl...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_07",
      "hash64": "A86EB693E1A4C20B",
      "text": "Es ist, als würde mich jemand beobachten.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_08",
      "hash64": "A86EB393E1A4BCF2",
      "text": "Und nicht etwa ein Pokémon, sondern ganz klar\\nein Mensch.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_09",
      "hash64": "A86EB493E1A4BEA5",
      "text": "Ich habe sogar meine Schwester gefragt, ob es\\nein Geist sein könnte...\\c\\nSie kennt sich mit so was aus, weißt du.\\nAber sie hielt es für unwahrscheinlich.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_10",
      "hash64": "A8722193E1A7ADB3",
      "text": "Vielleicht lauert ja irgendwo ein Schüler, der nur\\nauf den richtigen Moment wartet, um mir eine\\r\\nFrage zu stellen...?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_select_03",
      "hash64": "CA217EEB2A79A0B2",
      "text": "Könnte sein.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_select_04",
      "hash64": "CA2179EB2A799833",
      "text": "Tja, wer weiß?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_11",
      "hash64": "A8722093E1A7AC00",
      "text": "Hehe, dann wäre es zumindest kein Wunder, dass\\nich diese angespannten Blicke förmlich spüre.\\c\\nFalls du jemanden in der Nähe siehst, auf den\\ndas zutrifft, lass es mich bitte wissen.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 182,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_12",
      "hash64": "A8722393E1A7B119",
      "text": "Vielleicht wird es Zeit, dass ich von mir aus auf\\ndie Person zugehe und frage, was Sache ist![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_math_b_system_01",
      "hash64": "DC709FD679B0DEA7",
      "text": "Du hast dich noch ein bisschen mehr mit\\nSeñora Quendella angefreundet!",
